    "solution": "Walk onto the low relay and jump in place. Landing raises your platform while lowering its distant twin across the upper light duct. Walk along the raised gallery and cut the mirror from its left side. The mirror now faces the receiver, but the linked body still interrupts the beam. Return to the lift and land again: the lift descends while its twin rises out of the receiver path. The light opens the low starting-side exit.",
